NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/server.broker#tap kind=field
  digest=b3:e315c1677f1c7599e167863ae79548519f9819a3c7d740ca5112646dc712f8f2 file=neo/internal/server/sse.go range=35:39 lang=go exported=false byte_range=1207:1533
  sig=func(id string, ev server.Event)
  doc=tap, when set, receives every published event AFTER it is buffered and\nfanned out. It is the seam the engine uses to persist the durable\nworkspace trace (F3). It MUST be non-blocking (a queue enqueue), so it is\ninvoked outside the topic lock and never stalls the publish hot path.
