  digest=b3:406afd6e2f7972c7ba95289701fb2a284a8f8d0396126522845806ff8a6d57a3 file=neo/internal/server/automatrix_governor.go range=286:306 lang=go exported=false byte_range=11810:12438
  sig=func parseAlarmID(out string) string
  doc=parseAlarmID extracts the created alarm's id from the alarm_set result. The\nChronos CreateAlarmResponse is {"id":...,"next_fire_at":...,"status":...};\nMCP tool text is typically that JSON (possibly wrapped). Best-effort: parse\nthe first JSON object carrying an "id".
