  sig=func (s *session) attemptContext(parent context.Context) (context.Context, context.CancelFunc)
  doc=attemptContext bounds a SINGLE supervised attempt so one stuck agent run\ncan't consume the whole task wall-clock; the parent (task) context still\ngoverns the overall ceiling and barge-in cancellation.
